vironment, you’ll find an abundance of superb cultural and entertainment experiences, including museums, theatre, opera, professional sports, fine dining, exotic cuisine, and world-class shopping. See Current Openings for Faculty See Current Openings for Staff Read our application privacy policy Location & Map Carthage at a Glance Why We Love Kenosha Explore Carthage About Carthage Mission and Values Carthage Facilities 2001 Alford Park Drive Kenosha, WI 53140 (262) 551-8500 Contact Map & Directions Request Info Apply Visit Carthage Give Light that Travels | The Campaign For Carthage Athletics Bookstore Library/IT OneLogin The Bridge Virtual Tour Work at Carthage #carthageviews Instagram Facebook YouTube LinkedIn Merit Pages TikTok © Carthage College Privacy Policy Non-Discrimination Statement Policies Title IX This website uses cookies to measure traffic and improve your experience. Declining tracking cookies will set a single cookie to remember your preference. You can learn more by visiting our Privacy Policy . Accept Decline"
